{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">煮即食麵究竟加乜嘢餸先係正宗？有網民於討論區以「煮即食麵有乜嘢餸係必落？」發帖，隨即引發全網熱烈討論！樓主率先分享個人最愛搭配「蛋、韭菜餃、獅子狗」，不料大批網民完全不買帳，紛紛耍手擰頭，帖文更慘獲逾百個劣評。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Gemini_Generated_Image_swp7j2swp7j2swp7.jpeg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bJgZNAE14t1791363221.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Gemini_Generated_Image_swp7j2swp7j2swp7.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">樓主偏好的「韭菜餃」與「獅子狗」遭到嫌棄，但「蛋」則成為絕大多數網民的共識，紛紛留言狂推：「辛辣麵要落生蛋」、「太陽強（蛋）必落」、「燶邊煎蛋」，大讚「加隻蛋，咩麵都好食」。不過，亦有追求極致方便的網民反對：「我煮得公仔麵就係懶，仲要煎蛋，洗鑊我係無法想像。」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-07 下午4.49.34.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KxoRnQ3Uvg1791363234.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-07 下午4.49.34.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-07 下午4.49.58.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026h0rFXiyvqL1791363249.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-07 下午4.49.58.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">至於獲得高正評的配料，則由經典港式麵檔熱門配料包辦，包括午餐肉、五香肉丁及廚師腸。有網民更升級提出「即食麵五寶」的邪惡食法，即集齊午餐肉、沙嗲牛、五香肉丁、廚師腸及太陽蛋。各種邪惡配料大合集，亦惹來注重健康的網民留言打趣及提醒：「呢個post好明顯個個都係雙下巴大肚腩。」、「bmi超過30？」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T10:39:50.653765+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":384,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}